    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d65">

                <pb facs="0335" n="49" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg49"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/2843</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Philip</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-08-30T18:00:00+03:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 30, 1916, 6 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received September 2, 7 p.
                        m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2053. Ottoman Council of Ministers yesterday adopted decision subsequently
                    sanctioned by Imperial decree by which Turkey in common action with Germany and
                    Bulgaria declares war on Roumania.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Philip</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
